<title>UK: Exim Bank of Japan sets 400 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Exim Bank of Japan sets 400 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT-IMPORT BANK OF JAPAN</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    05.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    05.FEB.yr</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
